est country by total area, with the longest coastline of any country. Its border with the United States is the longest international land border. The country is characterized by a wide range of both meteorologic and geological regions. With a population of over 41 million, it has widely varying population densities, with the majority residing in its urban areas and large areas being sparsely populated. Its capital is Ottawa and its three largest metropolitan areas are Toronto, Montreal, and Vancouver.","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Canada","source":"Wikipedia","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","iso2":"CA"}],"arc":{"reports":167,"first_seen":"2026-10-10T11:05:22Z","first_title":"Lorne Gunter: Trump's hatred for Canada has permanently damaged world's best trade relationship","first_url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilwFBVV95cUxOYXRYMl9ZdGNpNWJuTnM2LTMweHlrUnhTLWYtbWtGRXYtUjg1bWtrUjY1cnktNjNxUFlndGFKS3kwM0l2TTFnZW5aX3hjeEQ0ZlBmUF8zZmlHZlRreGNKVjV2ekQ3Q1RlR1FsLWhxTVN2amtfNnlXNXVQWFJRU0NMb2hlZzB5TXZYYWFWVGk3czFsU0V3MUp3?oc=5","first_publisher":"Edmonton Journal","earlier":[{"id":"e_b7021bdcaad3","title":"Trump’s Canada Tariffs to Become Democrats’ First Target After Midterm Victory, Wyden Says Repeal Support","date":"2026-11-06T04:57:29Z","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","publisher":"Benzinga","verification":"single_source_report"},{"id":"e_89ca40a3b81c","title":"US-Canada trade deal would hurt European aluminium buyers: Andy Home","date":"2026-11-06T07:00:00Z","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","publisher":"TradingView","verification":"single_source_report"},{"id":"e_9d35e602fb28","title":"Democrats weigh measure to roll back Trump's Canada tariffs - report","date":"2026-11-06T09:17:53Z","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxPRjk3bmdPYW9GUXdiOWVnbU9Oci0tRkNGYU1jQndsWDZJbGJZMWNDZnlNaG9penVoZkk1NmZWajhNcV9MdjlUbjJpTjB2a2Jod2JzMmFsaFVaN1dQVklLUS1LVUlmdmhuTTRmTUJfTXgwZzZ4UnpKNDB4ZGo2RFN3YmhkVWkzQ0xtaFNUOW9vRjc1RDg?oc=5","publisher":"Seeking Al